      "annotation_id": "e9b9e3f7ad3d45f5b2a75175064c5fa4_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has taken treatment for 3 days at ProMed Hospital which can be made out from Ex.P.7 Discharge summary."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d11a6b6c9ed64f95a1c05b9a8132c367_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, considering the nature of injuries and Mallikarjuna .G.A vs United India Ins Co Ltd on 3 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/93094840/\n5 duration of treatment it can be said that the Petitioner may have require"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ba3c1bb4b03c4ae795dceddcfbc829e1_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled only for a sum of Rs.15,500/ under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "51df9818476b423f87be4c4ef90258e7_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "iv) LOSS OF FUTURE INCOME:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "215cd54965a9488283af6d15fa2dcd51_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On perusal of Exs.P.10 & 11/DL and Aadhar Card, the date of birth of the petitioner is 26.04.1994 and the accident occurred on 20.06.2022."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bcae5698f0ce4e6092b8f9db27a81304_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per these documents petitioner's age was 28 years as on the date of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "815d8cbde14e4252ab9fe6d35693328d_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the dictum laid down in Sarala Verma's case, the appropriate multiplier applicable to his age is 17."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7903cb2466e544a4a39193b7810a6161_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As such the petitioner is entitled to Rs.3,79,440/."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4055f0d7d3214feca5aeb2184f5cd965_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(Rs.15,500/ x 12 x 12% x 17 = Rs.3,79,440/ )."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fafcb03691044c07929cf01569b19b7b_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n (v) LOSS OF FUTURE AMENITIES AND  HAPPINESS:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f32c9e1426bc48a2bab047db66721428_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe Petitioner was aged about 28 years at the time of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f1e540a1646c4cfc817e972f4f0ee6be_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He has sustained grievous injury and as per consideration of this Tribunal, he is suffering from 12% functional disability."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6b7a8f56f5a1476da0d948142097f6c4_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Petitioner has to suffer this disability throughout his life."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "46160f940404434bac721ac19a3d983f_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Because of this he will have to lose some of the amenities and comforts."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "07ffaa9905b64c5e8b0ac985d6c3d9e6_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, considering the age and nature of injuries that the Petitioner has suffered, a sum of Rs.30,000/ is awarded under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "58dbc6c216ac4000aae72e46ee681656_113",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(vi) ATTENDANT, CONVEYANCE, FOOD AND NOURISHMENT CHARGES:\nAfter the accident, the Petitioner was treated in the above said hospitals, admitted for 3 days as an inpatient and discharged with advise."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "67629b55572649adbb8d28dcc59f088a_114",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, during this period he must have spent considerable amount on his food and nourishment, conveyance and attendant expenses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6c9caaa6635c4e3eb97111511df00f49_115",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the Petitioner is entitled for a sum of Rs.20,000/\nunder this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f96886c367fc43e885bd1ad24d88abba_116",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(vii) FUTURE MEDICAL EXPENSES:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "444d2b3693ea40558da42d05552cd63f_117",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the version of PW.2, the Petitioner has to undergo another surgery for removal of implant and the estimated cost of this surgery is around Rs.60,000/."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "37810c0877c04981906d048c68c1b379_118",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard the petitioner or the PW.2 have not produced any bills."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4ebb85ac693648f7a6b856b2be8d3b7b_119",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, looking at the earlier treatment cost and nature of injury and the evidence on record, it appears it would be justifiable if an amount of Rs.20,000/ is awarded to the Petitioner under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0ef2c95093a74408a4839756d6d73f13_120",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the Petitioner is awarded a sum of Rs.20,000/ under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c832ba28132e45bdbff5c42cd01e7b06_121",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "18. The Petitioner is entitled to compensation under the following heads:\n1. Pain & suffering Rs.60,000/\n2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3c5b8425996d412987e31acb49b0cacc_125",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "United India Ins Co Ltd"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8d699e6a0ed1404eb0fa93a62333a6d7_127",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If it is rounded off it comes around //Rs.6,42,600/ and same is awarded under different heads to the Petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f7a8e4d6c39f484182545b758e3698e7_128",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nLIABILITY 21."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8e6551180ffb4d2990d97e5c4b20c490_129",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The respondent No.1 has contended that the accident was caused due to self fall when the petitioner was drunk."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "035f30ce35c84b9abc0b319f9aec4c20_130",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, They did not prove their defence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8013259916204d9c9a7d25f0f989de6b_134",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ". \nWherein the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka has held that, 'the insurer cannot avoid his liability to satisfy the award under Sec.149 of MV Act on the ground that the driver of the offending vehicle was drunk'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "da469e9c8ff1490487d50f5444bbe456_138",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the petition needs to allowed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aa50303ca2ff4d5c953c6dd58cbb8d2a_139",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, issue No.2 held in the Affirmative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d4328e9668744663ad90d36066d73d98_140",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n22. Issue No.4:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "71bcbbba17324c7cb2b453d12b190173_141",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "For the reasons and discussions made above and finding to the above issues, this Tribunal proceeds to pass the following: ORDER"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e20fb09037fd4b44a170072a7b0f2d23_142",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc",
        "explicit_leakage_phrase"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bpetition\\s+is\\s+allowed\\b",
          "matched_text": "petition is allowed",
          "start": 4,
          "end": 23
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "The petition is allowed with cost."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "08827896345f47afb99ae06b99415322_143",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Petitioner is entitled for  compensation of Rs.6,42,600/ (Rupees Six Lakhs Forty Two Thousand and Six Hundred only) along with interest at 6% p.a. from the date of petition till the date of depositing the amount."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9757d538b86049b5a0a5d613ff5c01ff_144",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The respondents are jointly and severally liable to pay the said compensation to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b7d18b91159c486ba4926a941fe4899e_145",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHowever, the Respondent No.1/Insurer is directed to deposit the compensation amount with interest before this Tribunal within sixty days from the date of this award."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d807d68df73d4f4d874fef457321afcf_146",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nOn deposit of compensation and interest, entire amount shall be released in favour of the Petitioner by way of epayment on proper identification and due acknowledgment as per rules."
    }
